### Feature Order — DELETE físico / DELETE lógico (cancelación)
### Modalidad JWT + RBAC. El físico solo aplica a pedidos 'pendiente' o 'cancelado'.
@baseUrl = http://localhost:4000
@token = {{login.response.body.$.access_token}}
@id = 1

### LOGIN como admin (ejecutar PRIMERO: guarda el token en @token)
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/sesion/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "identifier": "admin",
  "password": "Admin123!"
}

###
# @name deleteOrderPhysical
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/pedidos/{{id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

# @name cancelOrder
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/pedidos/{{id}}/deactivate
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
